    "script": "def powerOffTheDevice() \n\tlogComment ====== powerOffTheDevice sequence start ======\n\tbattery 1\n\tusb0 1\n\tusb1 1\n\tlogComment ====== powerOffTheDevice sequence finish ======\n\ndef powerOnTheDevice()\n\tlogComment ====== powerOnTheDevice sequence start ======\n\tdelay 500\n\tbattery 0\n\tdelay 900\n\tusb0 0\n\tusb1 0\n\tdelay 30\n\tlogComment ====== powerOnTheDevice sequence finish ======\n\ndef powerOff()\n\tlogComment ====== powerOff start ======\n\tpowerOffTheDevice\n\tpkey 0\n\tvolup 0\n\tvoldn 0\n\tpedl 0\n\tlogComment ====== powerOff finish ======\n\ndef powerOn()\n\tlogComment ====== powerOn start ======\n\tpowerOff\n\tpowerOnTheDevice\n\tpkey 1\n\tdelay 800\n\tpkey 0\n\tlogComment ====== powerOn finish ======\n\ndef bootToEDL()\n\tlogComment ====== bootToEDL start ======\n\tpowerOffTheDevice\n\tpkey 0\n\tvolup 0\n\tvoldn 0\n\tpedl 1\n\tpowerOnTheDevice\n\tpkey 1\n\tdelay $edl\n\tpkey 0\n\tpedl 0\n\tlogComment ====== bootToEDL finish ======\n\ndef bootToSecondaryEDL()\n\tlogComment ====== bootToSecondaryEDL start ======\n\tpowerOffTheDevice\n\tpkey 0\n\tvolup 0\n\tvoldn 0\n\tsedl 1\n\tpowerOnTheDevice\n\tpkey 1\n\tdelay 800\n\tpkey 0\n\tdelay 1300\n\tsedl 0\n\tlogComment ====== bootToSecondaryEDL finish ======\n\ndef bootToUEFI()\n\tlogComment ====== bootToUEFIMenu start ======\n\tpowerOffTheDevice\n\t// Put buttons in a set state\n\tpkey 0\n\tvolup 1\n\tvoldn 0\n\tpedl 0\n\tpowerOnTheDevice\n\tpkey 1\n\tdelay $uefi\n\tpkey 0\n\tvolup 0\n\tdelay 12\n\tpkey 1\n\tvolup 1\n\tpkey 0\n\tvolup 0\n\tlogComment ====== bootToUEFIMenu finish ======\n\ndef bootToFastboot()\n\tlogComment ====== bootToFastboot start ======\n\tpowerOffTheDevice\n\tpkey 0\n\tvolup 0\n\tvoldn 1\n\tpedl 0\n\tpowerOnTheDevice\n\tpkey 1\n\tdelay 800\n\tpkey 0\n\tdelay $fastboot\n\tvoldn 0\n\tdelay 30\n\tvoldn 1\n\tvoldn 0\n\tlogComment ====== bootToFastboot finished ======",
